    "updated_at": "2022-01-18T13:34:49Z",
    "body": "I hadn't considered how the contents of the transcript would benefit from being able to use HTML markup in them. That would be a bigger change to the `<track>` element than I was thinking, particularly since `<track>` is a void element so the transcript couldn't go inline into the main HTML document that way. A new element does make more sense with that in mind.",
