    "updated_at": "2022-01-18T15:18:26Z",
    "body": "Instead of a new `<transcript>` element, maybe it could be a `transcript` attribute on a `<track>` element, which would be the ID of some other element on the page. So you could have a transcript in a regular paragraph element, give the paragraph an ID, and reference it with `<track transcript=\"paragraph_id\">`.\r\n\r\nThough I suppose that would require you to have a track element...",
