    "created_at": "2022-01-19T16:40:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-19T16:40:09Z",
    "body": "There is no `transcript` role though, which makes this not only an ask for a new element, but an ask for platforms to create an implement a new role.  ARIA would need to take that into consideration.\r\n\r\nSeems to me this is all worth fleshing out more...  But perhaps that should be done by creating an issue with open ui or open a discussion on the wicg?  ",
