    "updated_at": "2022-01-20T11:38:33Z",
    "body": "As noted in https://github.com/WICG/proposals/issues/45#issuecomment-1017400247, there's already an existing proposal/spec for transcripts.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
